<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 168.5 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thurs.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 168.5 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 168.48 million rand worth of South African bonds on Thursday -- a settlement day -- after buying 71.36 million rand the previous day, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
